WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.350
Someone once said...

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:54.190
There are bears who wrap themselves

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:59.690
in the ultimate, succulent, 
fresh, and crunchy cabbage...

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:03.730
The Cabbear!

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:14.880
There are hot springs where the highest 
quality, best tasting oden bubbles up...

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:19.550
The Oden Onsen!

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.620
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:28.920
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:37.560
Housewarming Party! Everyone 
Gather at the Sweets House!

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:53.610
The sky is clear and I feel great!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.320
Haven't been home for a while...

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.090
I wonder if Terry's doing well?

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:10.100
M-My house is gone!

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:13.270
It's nowhere to be found! 
There's nothing left!

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:18.440
Well, it was a house made 
of sweets, after all.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.740
Maybe it was completely 
eaten by animals and bugs...

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:24.240
Usually, I'm the one who eats it all.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.310
Shoot... Just thinking 
about it makes me hungry.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.020
Isn't that a Crab Pig?

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.420
Looks delish!

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.420
Terry!

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.590
You look great!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:43.790
I'm home, Terry!

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:50.330
Have you gotten a bit 
bigger while I was away?

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.640
Obasaurus!

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:56.870
You too? And what a tongue!

00:03:57.910 --> 00:03:59.010
I see!

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:03.750
This Crab Pig is a present from 
you two to welcome me back?

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:04.980
Thanks.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.390
Enough licking, already!

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:17.430
I give thanks to all this 
world's great bounty...

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:19.060
Let's eat!

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:24.900
Yum!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.270
The elegant sweetness of crab meat,

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:30.240
combined with the refreshing 
light fattiness of pork,

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.810
brings about an exquisite harmony!

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:35.040
Can't beat Crab Pig!

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:40.320
Although... I'm definitely going to 
have to do something about a house...

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.060
Yes, this is Smile Office.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:58.630
Yes? Oh! Yes, of course...

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:07.380
It's too big.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.450
It's no use, I can't!

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.010
How am I supposed to get 
on something that big?

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:14.420
Smile!

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:17.920
You've got a request from Toriko.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.750
He wants you to build him a new house.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.160
Again?!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:26.130
That Toriko... The second I build 
one, he eats it in no time flat.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.330
How many hundreds have 
I built for him by now?

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:31.300
Hey, Smile! Our motto is your name, remember?

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.500
Always smile to the clients, 
so show me a happy face!

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.340
That's disturbing!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.810
That smile's as low as they get!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:42.310
I'm so busy, I've forgotten how to smile!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.480
Toriko?

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:45.610
Hiya, Smile!

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:46.910
How long's it been?

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:49.480
Still doing work with 
that scowl on your face?

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:50.780
Don't bust my chops!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.520
I'm in a jam right now. The deadline 
for this event is approaching.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:58.190
I've also got work for the 
candy theme park, Sweets Land.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.530
What? Sweets Land?

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:03.000
Sounds awesome! Make me one, too!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.900
As if! That's a job on an 
entirely different scale!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:09.200
Hey. So you're choosing customers 
based on the size of the project?

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:13.010
And besides, I don't have the 
materials right now. I can't.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.370
Got it.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:17.240
This time, I'll gather 
the sweets for materials.

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:20.450
I'll get rare sweets 
that'll get you motivated.

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:21.610
Plus...

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:24.180
I'll let you have some of a legendary soup

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:26.180
that'll put a permanent smile on your face!

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:29.890
Wait, you don't mean...

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:40.470
D-Do you mean the C-Century Soup?

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.170
Always up on the news you are, Smile.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:44.900
I want it!

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:45.700
See?

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:48.370
Okay! I'll design the house right away!

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:50.940
The event stage and Sweets Land can wait!

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:53.280
Hey! What about your other work?

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:58.880
Forgive me... This is a chance for 
me to get back my smile for real.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.150
Oh.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.050
Then, suit yourself.

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:05.960
Thank you for the meal.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:08.930
Okay! Time to go hunting for 
some house building materials!

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.870
There they are!

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.340
Pudding Mushroom

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:18.000
There's a bunch of Pudding Mushrooms here!

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:21.470
I'll take these back as 
materials for my house.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:27.340
Donut Snail

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.570
Isn't that a Donut Snail?

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:26.410
Looks yummy!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:33.780
Marshmarock

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:34.020
That'll be good, too! A marshmallow 
big as a stone, Mashmarock!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.690
A Cotton Candy Tree!

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:39.220
Cotton Candy Tree

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:39.590
Nothing is better than 
this natural cotton candy!

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:45.760
Cookie Alpaca (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 7

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:44.630
A Cookie Alpaca! Terry, do it!

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:55.170
Great Job, Terry!

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:04.610
Lotus Kelp

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:02.210
Oba, great! Lotus Kelp!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.610
Pickled kelp from its leaves is a rare treat!

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:09.750
It's a carbonated lake.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.490
I'm heading in for a bit!

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:33.440
Jelly Fish, huh?

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:35.340
Looks delicious!

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:53.190
I've... never eaten this before.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.730
I found something interesting!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.110
Sweet Coral (Coral Exoskeleton) 
Capture Level < 1

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.910
Sweet Coral... This looks yummy, too!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.350
This seems to be a good spot.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:21.250
3-Fold, Spiked Punch!

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:34.100
There she blows! A natural 
chocolate fountain!

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.810
There's little pebble-like 
chocolates mixed in!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:44.540
Yum!

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:47.080
Okay! Let's gather up a bunch of them!

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:52.950
Three, two, one...

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:56.520
It's finally about to begin, 
the Gourmet King finals!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.460
And incredibly, the grand 
prize is 1 billion yen!

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:04.700
All kinds of Gourmet Hunters are out 
capturing incredibly delicious ingredients!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.400
Please, come join us!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.970
The event will be held here at this 
amazing, specially-built stage...

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:12.070
One, two, one, two...

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.140
It's not finished at all!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.110
Will they make it in time?

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:18.410
What are you doing, Smile-san?

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.040
You've got to get here soon or else...

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:22.780
Huh? A new house for Toriko?

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:25.650
Toriko's house?

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:30.120
Don't worry. I'll make sure I 
get it done by the deadline.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.720
Right. If you'll excuse me...

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:36.760
Sheesh, that Toriko...

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:40.330
I sure hope he's actually 
gathered the materials...

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.430
Hey ya, Smile!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.910
How about that, Smile?

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.650
This should be enough, right?

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.650
It'll be enough! In fact, it's way too much!

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:01.580
Are you trying to get me to 
build you an office building?

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:04.790
Maybe not as big as Sweets Land,

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.320
but make me something big and flashy!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:10.260
Something that'll last for 
a bit, even if I eat it.

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:14.000
I got you.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.600
So hold up your end of the 
bargain with the Century Soup.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.230
Leave it to me!

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:23.270
I wonder what kind of 
amazing house you'll build?

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:24.670
Can't wait!

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:39.320
I-It's finished!

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:42.960
Amazing! It's a castle made of sweets!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:44.230
Take good care of it.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:45.990
I know, I know!

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.000
Toriko!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.000
Toriko-san!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.330
Oh, everyone!

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:52.730
Howdy!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:55.940
Coco!

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.010
Hi, Toriko!

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:04.040
I haven't been here in a 
while. It's quite gorgeous...

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:04.810
Isn't it?

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.950
It's so luxurious!

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.580
You've got booze all 
stocked up, right, Toriko?

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.150
Although, I brought some myself...

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:13.890
It is quite beautiful...

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:15.090
Isn't it?

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:16.460
Toriko!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.890
Thanks a bunch for inviting me!

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.090
That makes me super happy!

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:24.060
This is your new house, right?

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.430
We'll be living here together in the future!

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:27.430
What are you...?

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.300
For breakfast, we'll eat sweets together,

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:31.840
watch TV together...

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:34.340
For lunch, we'll eat sweets together,

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:35.840
take a nap together...

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.340
For dinner, we'll eat sweets together,

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:39.710
and at night, we'll...

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:42.780
We'll be together all day long!

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:46.320
Our nest of sweet, sweet love!

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.450
What the heck?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.590
This is the Gourmet Architect, Smile.

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:55.660
He's the one who designed this house.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:56.960
It's a pleasure to meet everyone.

00:12:57.900 --> 00:12:59.400
Smile-san, could you be...

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.700
...the young genius Gourmet Architect

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:05.600
who designed what's called the face 
of Gourmet Town, the Gourmet Tower?!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:06.440
Um...

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:09.410
You also had a hand in designing the 
Gourmet Freeway and Gourmet Railroad!

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:11.640
Amazing!

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.680
I've heard the rumors about you, too.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:18.580
You're Chef Komatsu, the chef who 
completed the legendary Century Soup...

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:22.750
You're grinning too much, Komatsu!

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:25.090
You drink some of your soup?

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:28.490
Enough with the introductions!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:32.200
Let's get this housewarming 
party started already!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:35.130
You seem pretty sloshed already!

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:36.670
You just called me handsome!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.070
No, I didn't!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.570
Okay, let's head inside!

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:42.610
Even the entrance looks delicious!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.020
Amazing! Incredibly gorgeous!

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:32.220
Impressive work!

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:35.420
Maybe I went a little overboard...

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:38.190
That legendary soup really pulled me in.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:43.400
Oh, that's right! Komatsu, let 
Smile have some Century Soup.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.670
I promised him.

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.040
Right! I made sure to bring some!

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.440
That's it?! I wanna drink it!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.910
Right. I'll prepare it right away.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.710
Where is the kitchen?

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:01.120
What an amazing kitchen!

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:05.050
What are all these faucets?

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:06.250
Try opening them.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.220
"Warm... milk"?

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.290
It's warm milk!

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:19.800
There are also ones for hot 
chocolate and chilled juice.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.500
That's incredible.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:25.910
This sofa is made of marshmallow!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.480
Marshmarock!

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:33.250
It's perfect for sitting, and 
most importantly, delicious!

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.980
The curtains are pickled kelp!

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:38.820
That makes a perfect beer snack!

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.820
The hallway is pretty, too.

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:45.860
It is beautiful and delicious!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:51.700
The crunchy texture of this Sweet Coral 
decorating the wall is excellent.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:55.130
And the cookies on this wall 
are from a Cookie Alpaca...

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:57.740
Yes, delicious!

00:15:57.740 --> 00:16:01.110
Honestly, this house is wasted on Toriko!

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.980
A shower of carbonated water?

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:12.850
I can't get enough of that bubbly feeling!

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.790
This is natural cotton candy 
from a Cotton Candy Tree!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.130
Not sticky at all, but perfectly fluffy!

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:23.760
In this bed, Toriko will...

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:27.830
Yum...

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.240
Smile-san, go ahead!

00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:01.100
Such a deep, harmonious aroma...

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:08.310
So this is the legendary Century Soup...

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.380
Thank you for the food.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:35.530
So, so delicious!

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.830
It's entirely out of this world!

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:43.010
I remember... I remember now! 
This is what it means to smile!

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:44.040
Knife!

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.680
Knife, knife, knife, knife!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:50.010
Knife, knife, knife...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:51.750
Hey...

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.790
They're totally eating it!

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:02.220
H-Hey!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:06.460
If you keep eating at that pace, 
the house'll be gone in minutes!

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:09.000
But it's just so delicious!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.800
We can't stop!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.830
N-No!

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:17.140
Stop!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:24.010
It wasn't exactly easy to build, you know.

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:29.820
You people!

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:35.290
Smile, it was the best!

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.430
It really was amazing!

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.930
Looks, taste... Perfect!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:41.930
Beautiful.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.730
You are truly a genius architect.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:47.470
Please make us a house next!

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:50.300
Make me a pool filled with booze!

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:52.670
Use my ingredients, too.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:54.270
I'll give you a special discount.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:57.740
Anyway, for creating such 
a wonderful house...

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.650
Thank you!

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:08.290
Sure was delicious!

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:12.830
Everyone...

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:17.830
Wonderful!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.070
It was tough...

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.640
But I'm glad I worked hard at it.

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:34.610
Smile's living up to his name! That's rare!

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:38.080
So this is what it's like to smile, huh?

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:44.160
I've been so busy every day, I 
really did forget how to smile.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:47.430
Everyone, I'm the one who needs to thank you.

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:49.990
You're the ones who got me 
to remember how to smile.

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:56.270
Your work was just so amazing that 
we all couldn't help but smile!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.070
Chef Komatsu...

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:01.970
Smile...

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:05.340
So then, can't you make me another one?

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:07.180
Make another one!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.480
Not a chance!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.880
Huh? What happened?

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.020
Tina-san!

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:15.820
What are you doing here?

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:18.390
I've come to do a story 
on Toriko's new house...

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:20.490
Where? Where is it?

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.530
We already ate the whole thing!

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.630
You've got to be kidding me!

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:26.160
What about my scoop?!

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:29.430
I wanted to eat it, too...

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:31.900
That's some very un-beautiful 
timing you've got.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:33.570
Unfortunate for you, I suppose.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.140
Smile-san!

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.040
Hurry up and make the stage!

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.710
The one for the Gourmet King finals!

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:44.110
Oh, right!

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:45.350
I've gotta hurry.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:47.320
Gourmet King finals?

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:50.890
Yes! We should be gathering a ton of 
incredible ingredients on the stage.

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.790
Cocoa Eel, Sherbetomato...

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.160
Fried Oystrawberries and 
Black Haired Wine Cows!

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:56.330
All kinds!

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:58.660
Seriously? I'm totally there!

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:01.200
You're still planning on eating?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.740
I have to make this event 
a success, no matter what.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.080
Sabrina

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:26.320
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:28.160
Sabrina

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:37.230
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:44.140
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:47.910
Like you were toyed with

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:51.350
Like you were tasted

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:58.450
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:05.190
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:12.270
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:22:12.270 --> 00:22:17.000
Rottening fruit

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.570
Sabrina

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:24.610
Gourmet News!

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:27.210
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:32.080
Today we'll introduce the winners chosen

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:35.420
for the Toriko anime's 
Gourmet Monster Contest!

00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:37.920
Cabbear!

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:42.490
Oden Onsen!

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:46.400
Donuts Snail!

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:49.530
They were all incredible ideas!

00:22:49.530 --> 00:22:52.070
I'm so moved by the passion 
in your illustrations,

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:55.640
all the ills and frustrations 
of my job just washed away!

00:22:56.940 --> 00:22:59.240
Ills... Frustrations...

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:01.610
Illustrations...

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:04.980
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:10.050
An ingredients contest with the title of Gourmet King on the line!

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:11.560
Toriko, Coco, Sunny...

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:13.390
We're looking forward to seeing what you guys have!

00:23:13.800 --> 00:23:16.960
The Gourmet King Championship! Search for the Ultimate Sweets!

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:19.280
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
